(7338766, 1146577, 30364, '<td valign="top">Anything with a corvid in it is interesting to me.  I love those birds.  They''re the smartest of all birds and very possibly the smartest of all animals, so I''m not surprised that they''re now being employed as parking supervisors.  Actually, they''re kinda overqualified for the job.  <br/> <br/>Thanks for not ''straightening'' the horizon, a nitpick that matters only to those who think the earth is flat.  It isn''t; it''s quite bent, as you clearly demonstrate here.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I enjoyed your picture for those reasons and more, and I thank you for it.</td>', 'Anything with a corvid in it is interesting to me.  I love those birds.  They''re the smartest of all birds and very possibly the smartest of all animals, so I''m not surprised that they''re now being employed as parking supervisors.  Actually, they''re kinda overqualified for the job.   Thanks for not ''straightening'' the horizon, a nitpick that matters only to those who think the earth is flat.  It isn''t; it''s quite bent, as you clearly demonstrate here. Anyway, I enjoyed your picture for those reasons and more, and I thank you for it.', '2015-04-07 05:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
