(7338927, 1146652, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love this - mostly for the convincing authentic light - it feels like an authentic viewpoint without the mediation of photography. This, without a hint of colour and considerable noise is not much short of magic.<br/> <br/>Excellent. One of my 10s.</td>', 'I love this - mostly for the convincing authentic light - it feels like an authentic viewpoint without the mediation of photography. This, without a hint of colour and considerable noise is not much short of magic. Excellent. One of my 10s.', '2015-04-07 15:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338930, 1146354, 100393, '<td valign="top">Inspired aspect ratio and stand-out canine eyes. Dark and ambiguous, I like it a lot. A 10 from me, just for the stylishness.</td>', 'Inspired aspect ratio and stand-out canine eyes. Dark and ambiguous, I like it a lot. A 10 from me, just for the stylishness.', '2015-04-07 15:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338931, 1146534, 100393, '<td valign="top">Brilliant contrast made better by the translucence of the spectacles.<br/> <br/>Pristinely captured with a wonderful off-balance composition.<br/> <br/>Great stuff. 10 from me.</td>', 'Brilliant contrast made better by the translucence of the spectacles. Pristinely captured with a wonderful off-balance composition. Great stuff. 10 from me.', '2015-04-07 15:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338937, 1146435, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love the segmentation of this - three photos in one. I like how ''Frank'' is using her tray to give her a friendly sniff. I like how the guy in the hat is everybody''s best friend; like the hat, he wears the label well.<br/> <br/>Excellent composition and bold processing. I really like the deep black of her dress.</td>', 'I love the segmentation of this - three photos in one. I like how ''Frank'' is using her tray to give her a friendly sniff. I like how the guy in the hat is everybody''s best friend; like the hat, he wears the label well. Excellent composition and bold processing. I really like the deep black of her dress.', '2015-04-07 15:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338942, 1146528, 100393, '<td valign="top">They sit transfixed sharing perspectives on the forms in front of them - separated by the moat of doom!<br/> <br/>The arching partial vignette a sign of menace. They are at a safe distance here, but only just. If this had an audio track, it would be the sound of an apocalyptic siren.<br/> <br/>Great tones and really well constructed.</td>', 'They sit transfixed sharing perspectives on the forms in front of them - separated by the moat of doom! The arching partial vignette a sign of menace. They are at a safe distance here, but only just. If this had an audio track, it would be the sound of an apocalyptic siren. Great tones and really well constructed.', '2015-04-07 15:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338943, 1146472, 100393, '<td valign="top">Deep tones and details with a splash of human interest invading the earthy roots. Like two separate photos, the top and bottom sit in juxtaposition.<br/> <br/>Effective.</td>', 'Deep tones and details with a splash of human interest invading the earthy roots. Like two separate photos, the top and bottom sit in juxtaposition. Effective.', '2015-04-07 15:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338945, 1146634, 100393, '<td valign="top">Super composition and a brilliant palette. Really effective textures too.<br/> <br/>I have her looking at you looking at her. I wonder what she thinks.<br/> <br/>Bumping to a 9.</td>', 'Super composition and a brilliant palette. Really effective textures too. I have her looking at you looking at her. I wonder what she thinks. Bumping to a 9.', '2015-04-07 15:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338947, 1146490, 100393, '<td valign="top">Like a layer-cake. The guy should be on top, for he truly is the icing!<br/> <br/>A real sense of environment here - your photograph feels inhabited.<br/> <br/>I love this glimpse of the life of another.<br/> <br/>Bumping to a 9.</td>', 'Like a layer-cake. The guy should be on top, for he truly is the icing! A real sense of environment here - your photograph feels inhabited. I love this glimpse of the life of another. Bumping to a 9.', '2015-04-07 15:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338948, 1146371, 100393, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition of a familiar subject. The blur in her hand communicates movement.<br/> <br/>The lighting is superb.<br/> <br/>A very effective shot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition of a familiar subject. The blur in her hand communicates movement. The lighting is superb. A very effective shot.', '2015-04-07 15:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338950, 1146473, 100393, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary image with a perfect title. Great foreground, brilliantly chosen texture and a shadowy betrunked blur that is a marvel to behold.<br/> <br/>Like a screen print as photo - the longer I look, the more I am powerless to resist its charm.<br/> <br/>Bumping to a 10 - just for making me feel sentimental.</td>', 'Extraordinary image with a perfect title. Great foreground, brilliantly chosen texture and a shadowy betrunked blur that is a marvel to behold. Like a screen print as photo - the longer I look, the more I am powerless to resist its charm. Bumping to a 10 - just for making me feel sentimental.', '2015-04-07 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338952, 1146249, 100393, '<td valign="top">Helmet turns to 70s disco afro! I love that - disco yellow jumpsuit with red collar and some flairs to show off some moves!<br/> <br/>The dynamism only serves to reinforce the sense of disco fever!<br/> <br/>Great stuff.</td>', 'Helmet turns to 70s disco afro! I love that - disco yellow jumpsuit with red collar and some flairs to show off some moves! The dynamism only serves to reinforce the sense of disco fever! Great stuff.', '2015-04-07 15:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338955, 1146577, 100393, '<td valign="top">Remarkable geology meets serial killer''s picnic spot. Darkly ominous.<br/> <br/>How many bodies have been carried in that pickup?<br/> <br/>I like the tilt too - complying with convention would not be appropriate for this image''s mood.<br/> <br/>Very effective image.</td>', 'Remarkable geology meets serial killer''s picnic spot. Darkly ominous. How many bodies have been carried in that pickup? I like the tilt too - complying with convention would not be appropriate for this image''s mood. Very effective image.', '2015-04-07 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338956, 1145883, 30214, '<td valign="top">I am very curious what Ubique will write about this :)</td>', 'I am very curious what Ubique will write about this :)', '2015-04-07 15:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338957, 1146564, 100393, '<td valign="top">A photo within a photo with a lovely cross-processed look. I like the inner photo the best, the chrome forms a portal to 1976. Evocative of that remarkable summer.<br/> <br/>All dogs were hot that year.<br/> <br/>I like this a lot.</td>', 'A photo within a photo with a lovely cross-processed look. I like the inner photo the best, the chrome forms a portal to 1976. Evocative of that remarkable summer. All dogs were hot that year. I like this a lot.', '2015-04-07 15:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338959, 1146658, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but kind of cliche theme (not ubique''s fare for sure), and I''m also not wild about blurring the edges</td>', 'nice photo, but kind of cliche theme (not ubique''s fare for sure), and I''m also not wild about blurring the edges', '2015-04-07 15:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338960, 1146620, 100393, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the references in this image! The blur has caused the appearance of savagery and the red play thing enacts its role in building the drama.<br/> <br/>On the edge of parody, I like that.</td>', 'I enjoy the references in this image! The blur has caused the appearance of savagery and the red play thing enacts its role in building the drama. On the edge of parody, I like that.', '2015-04-07 15:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338961, 1146660, 30214, '<td valign="top">lovely photo, the bird really brings it to life! And the color palette brings to mind ubique''s recent offerings from the bush</td>', 'lovely photo, the bird really brings it to life! And the color palette brings to mind ubique''s recent offerings from the bush', '2015-04-07 15:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338964, 1146629, 100393, '<td valign="top">Straight up and straight across. A race to the end - a visual metaphor for life where everybody hopes they''ll make it to the other side.<br/> <br/>The guy walking away isn''t playing. He''ll live forever.</td>', 'Straight up and straight across. A race to the end - a visual metaphor for life where everybody hopes they''ll make it to the other side. The guy walking away isn''t playing. He''ll live forever.', '2015-04-07 15:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338965, 1146662, 30214, '<td valign="top">when I think of echoes in photography, I usually think about two unrelated objects resembling each other. Here however one is just a shadow of another, so echo is not surprising. Still, nice framing.</td>', 'when I think of echoes in photography, I usually think about two unrelated objects resembling each other. Here however one is just a shadow of another, so echo is not surprising. Still, nice framing.', '2015-04-07 15:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338966, 1146411, 100393, '<td valign="top">A nice image with an embedded ''aha'' moment. Cleverly constructed and effective as a consequence.</td>', 'A nice image with an embedded ''aha'' moment. Cleverly constructed and effective as a consequence.', '2015-04-07 15:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338967, 1146436, 30214, '<td valign="top">nicely caught and framed!</td>', 'nicely caught and framed!', '2015-04-07 15:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338968, 1146587, 30214, '<td valign="top">ominous framing, I like it</td>', 'ominous framing, I like it', '2015-04-07 15:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338969, 1146710, 100393, '<td valign="top">The transected face makes this for me. Take no prisoners with your crop - commendable.<br/> <br/>You''ve made this a scene of time and space, the people are passing through and hanging out... incidental tourists in your documentation of the mannequin bride and her abode.<br/> <br/>Well constructed and highly disciplined. I like it.</td>', 'The transected face makes this for me. Take no prisoners with your crop - commendable. You''ve made this a scene of time and space, the people are passing through and hanging out... incidental tourists in your documentation of the mannequin bride and her abode. Well constructed and highly disciplined. I like it.', '2015-04-07 15:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338970, 1146267, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour, most weren''t so bold. The muted, North Sea green hues has me seeing these as dresses for mermaids - she stands on a tail in my mind, the dresses will keep her secret safe.<br/> <br/>Great moment, very well preserved. Bumping to a 9.</td>', 'Great use of colour, most weren''t so bold. The muted, North Sea green hues has me seeing these as dresses for mermaids - she stands on a tail in my mind, the dresses will keep her secret safe. Great moment, very well preserved. Bumping to a 9.', '2015-04-07 15:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338972, 1146587, 100393, '<td valign="top">Clever composition where viewer participation comes for free. Will opening the door show me the car or banish a reflection. In that choice we would reveal whether we are inside or outside - as it stands we are subject to quantum ambiguity - the moment allows us to be both.</td>', 'Clever composition where viewer participation comes for free. Will opening the door show me the car or banish a reflection. In that choice we would reveal whether we are inside or outside - as it stands we are subject to quantum ambiguity - the moment allows us to be both.', '2015-04-07 15:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338973, 1146588, 100393, '<td valign="top">A curious tale that may never be properly told. Connected strangers uncaring of each other''s life.<br/> <br/>I''m impressed by you, the photographer, effectively adjunct - attached to the scene but not part of it. You are the invisible man.</td>', 'A curious tale that may never be properly told. Connected strangers uncaring of each other''s life. I''m impressed by you, the photographer, effectively adjunct - attached to the scene but not part of it. You are the invisible man.', '2015-04-07 15:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338975, 1145746, 100393, '<td valign="top">I like how you have captured something ephemeral. This precise arrangement of particles has never occurred before and will never occur again.<br/> <br/>You''ve made that tangible. All photos are a record of a moment but this more so than most, the scene itself unremarkable, its ephemerality total and dominating.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'I like how you have captured something ephemeral. This precise arrangement of particles has never occurred before and will never occur again. You''ve made that tangible. All photos are a record of a moment but this more so than most, the scene itself unremarkable, its ephemerality total and dominating. Well done.', '2015-04-07 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338977, 1146054, 100393, '<td valign="top">As stylish as it is stylised. They wish to be somebody, to become nothing offends their sensibilities. In the end, it wasn''t worth getting dressed up for this....<br/> <br/>The lines are important too - for me, its the bars of their prison, they have to stay, fixed in the ''x'' and ''y'' planes as entropy consumes their magnificent selves.<br/> <br/>Bumping to an 8.</td>', 'As stylish as it is stylised. They wish to be somebody, to become nothing offends their sensibilities. In the end, it wasn''t worth getting dressed up for this.... The lines are important too - for me, its the bars of their prison, they have to stay, fixed in the ''x'' and ''y'' planes as entropy consumes their magnificent selves. Bumping to an 8.', '2015-04-07 15:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338978, 1146719, 100393, '<td valign="top">A trick, and a good one too. I love juxtapositions and this one works so well - it feels surreal and communicates a sense of irony somehow.<br/> <br/>Nicely conceived and made.</td>', 'A trick, and a good one too. I love juxtapositions and this one works so well - it feels surreal and communicates a sense of irony somehow. Nicely conceived and made.', '2015-04-07 15:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338979, 1146715, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting look at the world.</td>', 'This is an interesting look at the world.', '2015-04-07 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338980, 1146105, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is beyond creepy. Even though it shouldn''t be.</td>', 'This is beyond creepy. Even though it shouldn''t be.', '2015-04-07 15:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338981, 1146660, 100393, '<td valign="top">Clouds become plates of ice, the trees have endured enough winter and the bird is a witness to the torment.<br/> <br/>I like the compositional balance of this shot.</td>', 'Clouds become plates of ice, the trees have endured enough winter and the bird is a witness to the torment. I like the compositional balance of this shot.', '2015-04-07 15:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338982, 1146364, 100393, '<td valign="top">It is as you say. An honest shot made effective by the guy on the pier. We understand what ''our'' photographer is shooting.</td>', 'It is as you say. An honest shot made effective by the guy on the pier. We understand what ''our'' photographer is shooting.', '2015-04-07 15:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338983, 1146662, 100393, '<td valign="top">Shadow and cause united. I like the overdeveloped glow, it has a sparkle about it.</td>', 'Shadow and cause united. I like the overdeveloped glow, it has a sparkle about it.', '2015-04-07 15:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338984, 1146720, 114225, '<td valign="top">Finally, an image with some life to it.</td>', 'Finally, an image with some life to it.', '2015-04-07 15:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338985, 1146528, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is cool.</td>', 'Wow, that is cool.', '2015-04-07 15:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338986, 1146458, 100393, '<td valign="top">Our privileged pair care not for his torment. They know they are better. It would be a crime against nature to move to undo the disparity in their lots.<br/> <br/>A metaphor for the modern world. Well done.</td>', 'Our privileged pair care not for his torment. They know they are better. It would be a crime against nature to move to undo the disparity in their lots. A metaphor for the modern world. Well done.', '2015-04-07 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338989, 1146239, 100393, '<td valign="top">The spectacle lens grounds the image for me - an anchor around which the rest pivots. The steering wheels adds to the sense of ''turnability''.<br/> <br/>I like how the photograph transcends the scene. It that sense, I think you have the measure of the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'The spectacle lens grounds the image for me - an anchor around which the rest pivots. The steering wheels adds to the sense of ''turnability''. I like how the photograph transcends the scene. It that sense, I think you have the measure of the challenge. Well done.', '2015-04-07 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338990, 1146714, 100393, '<td valign="top">Oh, how I know Ubique likes some drama! His words of advice to me have included getting in close and dirty, especially when it kicks off. It can''t be real though can it? That pistol is in grabbling distance, even if a grab would lead to a head shot.<br/> <br/>It looks convincing though so I have to consider that possibility...<br/> <br/>Very interesting image.</td>', 'Oh, how I know Ubique likes some drama! His words of advice to me have included getting in close and dirty, especially when it kicks off. It can''t be real though can it? That pistol is in grabbling distance, even if a grab would lead to a head shot. It looks convincing though so I have to consider that possibility... Very interesting image.', '2015-04-07 15:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338991, 1145865, 100393, '<td valign="top">Lovely dog, gently captured. The foreground obscuration is the making of the image.<br/> <br/>Delicate and delightful.</td>', 'Lovely dog, gently captured. The foreground obscuration is the making of the image. Delicate and delightful.', '2015-04-07 15:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7338992, 1146598, 100393, '<td valign="top">I love this - the title too. One of two gulls arrive with the rain, his ark parked beyond the wall.<br/> <br/>The graffiti, a signature of a spoilt world that he''ll miss less than much.<br/> <br/>Great tones, excellent story, beautifully subdued.<br/> <br/>The split tones are magnificent.<br/> <br/>Magic. And a 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this - the title too. One of two gulls arrive with the rain, his ark parked beyond the wall. The graffiti, a signature of a spoilt world that he''ll miss less than much. Great tones, excellent story, beautifully subdued. The split tones are magnificent. Magic. And a 10 from me.', '2015-04-07 16:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
