(7338994, 1146271, 12611, '<td valign="top">This really does work- it has an uneasy, anxiety inducing quality- perhaps because of the tight crop or zoom, the grain and the lo-fi quality. What is outside the frame? where are the windows? We may never know.</td>', 'This really does work- it has an uneasy, anxiety inducing quality- perhaps because of the tight crop or zoom, the grain and the lo-fi quality. What is outside the frame? where are the windows? We may never know.', '2015-04-07 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
