(7339047, 1145714, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cool capture. It''s as if there are three slices of depth to this, like three separate photos (of the front door, of her, and of the background, which seems entirely detached as well) have been stuck together. Looking closer it''s as if her hand is her link to here and now, grasping, while she is fighting fading away into the dreamy yet ubiquitous wash of parking lots and overpasses. Cool photo.</td>', 'Cool capture. It''s as if there are three slices of depth to this, like three separate photos (of the front door, of her, and of the background, which seems entirely detached as well) have been stuck together. Looking closer it''s as if her hand is her link to here and now, grasping, while she is fighting fading away into the dreamy yet ubiquitous wash of parking lots and overpasses. Cool photo.', '2015-04-07 18:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
