(7339595, 1146620, 124815, '<td valign="top">Could something so vicious become so endearing? You proved it right. It is a lovely shot and the eye of your dog is very intelligent; the other might be crying!<br/>bump</td>', 'Could something so vicious become so endearing? You proved it right. It is a lovely shot and the eye of your dog is very intelligent; the other might be crying!bump', '2015-04-08 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339597, 1146528, 124815, '<td valign="top">excellent title and, yes, the vignette might be too pronounced and you might have wanted to place it on all sides as well: in for a penny, in for a pound!</td>', 'excellent title and, yes, the vignette might be too pronounced and you might have wanted to place it on all sides as well: in for a penny, in for a pound!', '2015-04-08 12:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
