(7339736, 1146240, 113411, '<td valign="top">What a great tribute to Ubique. The framing, pov and processing is great. The shtik is unmistakable. Well done!</td>', 'What a great tribute to Ubique. The framing, pov and processing is great. The shtik is unmistakable. Well done!', '2015-04-08 16:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339739, 1146712, 113411, '<td valign="top">OK, this is my favorite. What a great tribute to Ubique and at the same time a work of art. I love the colors, the graphics and the way you have processed it. I would frame this an hang it on a wall. Really fabulous. I wish it would make the top three but I am afraid it is too subtle, understated and wonderful for that.</td>', 'OK, this is my favorite. What a great tribute to Ubique and at the same time a work of art. I love the colors, the graphics and the way you have processed it. I would frame this an hang it on a wall. Really fabulous. I wish it would make the top three but I am afraid it is too subtle, understated and wonderful for that.', '2015-04-08 16:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339740, 1145746, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful. It is so ethereal and soft and the tinge of color is perfect. I am not see Ubique as much as I am seeing abstract beauty. It is wonderful!</td>', 'This is simply beautiful. It is so ethereal and soft and the tinge of color is perfect. I am not see Ubique as much as I am seeing abstract beauty. It is wonderful!', '2015-04-08 16:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
