(7339758, 1146620, 113411, '<td valign="top">How fabulous. I can just hear the blood curdling squeal as the beast is demolishing his prey. Told with the perfect amount of enigma and shtik and the processing is perfect too!</td>', 'How fabulous. I can just hear the blood curdling squeal as the beast is demolishing his prey. Told with the perfect amount of enigma and shtik and the processing is perfect too!', '2015-04-08 16:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
