(7339806, 1146458, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great capture, especially the woman on the right and the newspaper. I like the processing-softly blown high lights.</td>', 'Great capture, especially the woman on the right and the newspaper. I like the processing-softly blown high lights.', '2015-04-08 20:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
