(7339808, 1146587, 50864, '<td valign="top">Unique and interesting. I like it.</td>', 'Unique and interesting. I like it.', '2015-04-08 20:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339814, 1146658, 50695, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote because I saw this on Facebook. Welcome back, by the way. The subject couldn''t be better, and the lighting is good. The only negative for me is the excessive blur on the sides. I hope that wasn''t ubique''s evil influence. He is a notorious vignettist.</td>', 'I didn''t vote because I saw this on Facebook. Welcome back, by the way. The subject couldn''t be better, and the lighting is good. The only negative for me is the excessive blur on the sides. I hope that wasn''t ubique''s evil influence. He is a notorious vignettist.', '2015-04-08 20:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339820, 1146403, 50695, '<td valign="top">oh dark cows feeding upon darkness, what is the milk of your efforts? and who dares to drink of it?<br/> <br/>one night I saw cows grazing upon stars<br/>and I thought what strange motion<br/>will make those stars visible again?<br/>because we tend to think like Aristotle<br/>that heavenly bodies are fixed, permanent in motion or permanently still,<br/>immune to the forces that pull an apple from a tree <br/>and wither it away, but now we know,<br/>now we know,<br/>the stars are tears of God,<br/>glimmering then gone.</td>', 'oh dark cows feeding upon darkness, what is the milk of your efforts? and who dares to drink of it? one night I saw cows grazing upon starsand I thought what strange motionwill make those stars visible again?because we tend to think like Aristotlethat heavenly bodies are fixed, permanent in motion or permanently still,immune to the forces that pull an apple from a tree and wither it away, but now we know,now we know,the stars are tears of God,glimmering then gone.', '2015-04-08 20:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339826, 1145853, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes, memories are like this, clinging to the mundane walls of everyday like giant Sadistic spiders.<br/> <br/>and what are those....?<br/> <br/>Eggs, my dear, eggs.......</td>', 'Yes, memories are like this, clinging to the mundane walls of everyday like giant Sadistic spiders. and what are those....? Eggs, my dear, eggs.......', '2015-04-08 21:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339831, 1146239, 96751, '<td valign="top">Looks as though she is being observed by those bokeh eyes</td>', 'Looks as though she is being observed by those bokeh eyes', '2015-04-08 21:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339864, 1146472, 65319, '<td valign="top">Gritty tree roots...could be an Ent from the Hobbit.  I like the energy added by the sneaker feet.  This one speaks to me...10</td>', 'Gritty tree roots...could be an Ent from the Hobbit.  I like the energy added by the sneaker feet.  This one speaks to me...10', '2015-04-08 23:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339865, 1146648, 108069, '<td valign="top">Full stop indeed. Unless you believe otherwise, of course. Well seen, quirky fun (did I say that?) capture.</td>', 'Full stop indeed. Unless you believe otherwise, of course. Well seen, quirky fun (did I say that?) capture.', '2015-04-08 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339866, 1146457, 65319, '<td valign="top">Ah...Wheezing mud...the oily opalescence creates an  interesting sense of texture and mystery.  The vignette seems a bit over planted.  9</td>', 'Ah...Wheezing mud...the oily opalescence creates an  interesting sense of texture and mystery.  The vignette seems a bit over planted.  9', '2015-04-08 23:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339867, 1146435, 65319, '<td valign="top">Full of Ubique-y whimsy!  I envy your sense of timing.  I hope this one does well for you.  9</td>', 'Full of Ubique-y whimsy!  I envy your sense of timing.  I hope this one does well for you.  9', '2015-04-08 23:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339868, 1146240, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nicely framed. Turns what is likely a cluttered (but surely beautiful) scene into a neat abstract.</td>', 'Very nicely framed. Turns what is likely a cluttered (but surely beautiful) scene into a neat abstract.', '2015-04-08 23:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339869, 1146471, 65319, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t decide at what point this becomes a literal tail while still remaining a fairy tale.  So, I stared at it for a while and decided upon a 9.</td>', 'I couldn''t decide at what point this becomes a literal tail while still remaining a fairy tale.  So, I stared at it for a while and decided upon a 9.', '2015-04-08 23:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339870, 1146634, 65319, '<td valign="top">Bump to 10...that Ponyo grumpy face is perfect.  This one made me laugh.  Thanks!</td>', 'Bump to 10...that Ponyo grumpy face is perfect.  This one made me laugh.  Thanks!', '2015-04-08 23:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339871, 1145865, 65319, '<td valign="top">This image is wise and tender.  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24454" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SandyP</a>?  Love this one!  9</td>', 'This image is wise and tender.   SandyP?  Love this one!  9', '2015-04-08 23:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339872, 1146354, 108069, '<td valign="top">A slice of life within the void. And I''ve just realized we''re the ones being pursued. Creepy eyes.</td>', 'A slice of life within the void. And I''ve just realized we''re the ones being pursued. Creepy eyes.', '2015-04-08 23:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339873, 1146105, 65319, '<td valign="top">Priceless...9</td>', 'Priceless...9', '2015-04-08 23:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339875, 1146458, 65319, '<td valign="top">A fascinating set of misplaced variables all trapped together. The grain works well here.</td>', 'A fascinating set of misplaced variables all trapped together. The grain works well here.', '2015-04-08 23:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339877, 1146472, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great tones. Great contrast, in light and shadow as well as in a rooted resident vs. passersby bee-bopping along. Very nice stuff.</td>', 'Great tones. Great contrast, in light and shadow as well as in a rooted resident vs. passersby bee-bopping along. Very nice stuff.', '2015-04-08 23:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339878, 1145712, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great reference. I love the song about not having the proper power adapter for the bed blender. What a mix. Cool photo.</td>', 'Great reference. I love the song about not having the proper power adapter for the bed blender. What a mix. Cool photo.', '2015-04-08 23:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339881, 1146715, 108069, '<td valign="top">Texture vs. blurred wash in a bowl of contrast. Please sir, I want some more. Except the lone cobweb spindle. Pretty, but I''ve had my fill of that. Sweet photo.</td>', 'Texture vs. blurred wash in a bowl of contrast. Please sir, I want some more. Except the lone cobweb spindle. Pretty, but I''ve had my fill of that. Sweet photo.', '2015-04-08 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339887, 1146626, 108069, '<td valign="top">Contrast arranged so perfectly when I step back and view it from afar. And contrast in real life as well. Is that a dashboard hula dancer hanging out with a tachometer? Stay fresh. Cool photo.</td>', 'Contrast arranged so perfectly when I step back and view it from afar. And contrast in real life as well. Is that a dashboard hula dancer hanging out with a tachometer? Stay fresh. Cool photo.', '2015-04-08 23:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339899, 1146458, 138630, '<td valign="top">So close and yet so far - worlds apart.  The bars are wonderful.</td>', 'So close and yet so far - worlds apart.  The bars are wonderful.', '2015-04-09 01:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339903, 1146658, 138630, '<td valign="top">Poignant.  Priceless.  The beginning and the end - all the same, really.  I love the way his arms complete the circle.</td>', 'Poignant.  Priceless.  The beginning and the end - all the same, really.  I love the way his arms complete the circle.', '2015-04-09 01:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339905, 1146222, 159132, '<td valign="top">I love man made stuff. And this composition is wonderful. It must have once been pristine, but now it is grimy. Incredibly intricate, but also primitive. The hue of the bokeh is great, and even the vignette is good (although I am not often a fan of that). The blurred components in the rear make me wonder what their details are, while leading my attention to the front gear. All good.</td>', 'I love man made stuff. And this composition is wonderful. It must have once been pristine, but now it is grimy. Incredibly intricate, but also primitive. The hue of the bokeh is great, and even the vignette is good (although I am not often a fan of that). The blurred components in the rear make me wonder what their details are, while leading my attention to the front gear. All good.', '2015-04-09 01:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7339906, 1146158, 159132, '<td valign="top">Totally interesting. I love how different aspects of the natural world have more similarities than we think, or that even make sense. This is probably a bird''s neck but it can just as easily be some plant or mineral formation. Nice</td>', 'Totally interesting. I love how different aspects of the natural world have more similarities than we think, or that even make sense. This is probably a bird''s neck but it can just as easily be some plant or mineral formation. Nice', '2015-04-09 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1);
