(7340149, 1146135, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s a ton of stuff going on in this image, from the guy peering at the camera to a reverse KKK religious procession.  Onlookers, a welter of architecture and even a snatch of Picasso over the left shoulder of the foremost marcher.  It''s a scene out of a Fellini movie, cacophonous and irrepressible.  The viewer is swept along with this joyride.  Terrifically fun and enchanting.</td>', 'There''s a ton of stuff going on in this image, from the guy peering at the camera to a reverse KKK religious procession.  Onlookers, a welter of architecture and even a snatch of Picasso over the left shoulder of the foremost marcher.  It''s a scene out of a Fellini movie, cacophonous and irrepressible.  The viewer is swept along with this joyride.  Terrifically fun and enchanting.', '2015-04-09 18:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
