(7340626, 1146057, 50695, '<td valign="top">perhaps someone who is not a fan of ubique. This is interesting as a rebellious flipping off of the topic. The well-worn idea that art is masturbatory, and even worse, masturbation in front of a mirror. That pursuit of spirituality in blurriness is just a descent into a meaningless abyss. Better to enjoy the pretty landscapes while you''re still alive to see them, and ignore the darkness within. Not an opinion I agree with, but this is a strong visual argument for it. "A might too strong..."</td>', 'perhaps someone who is not a fan of ubique. This is interesting as a rebellious flipping off of the topic. The well-worn idea that art is masturbatory, and even worse, masturbation in front of a mirror. That pursuit of spirituality in blurriness is just a descent into a meaningless abyss. Better to enjoy the pretty landscapes while you''re still alive to see them, and ignore the darkness within. Not an opinion I agree with, but this is a strong visual argument for it. "A might too strong..."', '2015-04-10 13:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340627, 1145883, 50695, '<td valign="top">this shot is about prettiness, so I would suggest lightening it up a bit, or increasing the contrast... something along those lines.</td>', 'this shot is about prettiness, so I would suggest lightening it up a bit, or increasing the contrast... something along those lines.', '2015-04-10 13:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
