(7340658, 1146563, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a more daring aesthetic stance than blurry black and white. Colors taken to such extremes are more difficult to look at. But I think you''ve succeeded here. The colors are odd and distorted, but they don''t clash and they are muted. I find the overall effect very pleasing to look at.</td>', 'This is a more daring aesthetic stance than blurry black and white. Colors taken to such extremes are more difficult to look at. But I think you''ve succeeded here. The colors are odd and distorted, but they don''t clash and they are muted. I find the overall effect very pleasing to look at.', '2015-04-10 13:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340659, 1146471, 50695, '<td valign="top">a wire pretending to be a line. shapes on a wall interacting with this faux line to create faux images, a profile perhaps, but never quite. but definitely with pierced earrings. also a little intrigued by that poor bottle that won''t be pouring booze anytime soon.</td>', 'a wire pretending to be a line. shapes on a wall interacting with this faux line to create faux images, a profile perhaps, but never quite. but definitely with pierced earrings. also a little intrigued by that poor bottle that won''t be pouring booze anytime soon.', '2015-04-10 13:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
