(7340790, 1146626, 109227, '<td valign="top">Nostalgia at it''s best.  I remember these dolls from my younger years and it always brought thoughts of a tropical paradise beyond my reach and dreams of one day seeing this in real life.  Funny, it still brings back memories but now they are memories of my youth and how I miss that innocent time in life.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nostalgia at it''s best.  I remember these dolls from my younger years and it always brought thoughts of a tropical paradise beyond my reach and dreams of one day seeing this in real life.  Funny, it still brings back memories but now they are memories of my youth and how I miss that innocent time in life.  Nicely done.', '2015-04-10 20:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340791, 1146598, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great title.  The image brings a sense of sadness for this poor man have no place to get out of the weather.  The graffiti on the bench and the tones adds to this illusion.  Gloom and doom comes to mind; I hope it is just an illusion.</td>', 'Great title.  The image brings a sense of sadness for this poor man have no place to get out of the weather.  The graffiti on the bench and the tones adds to this illusion.  Gloom and doom comes to mind; I hope it is just an illusion.', '2015-04-10 21:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340792, 1146473, 100831, '<td valign="top">The little things I love... touching.</td>', 'The little things I love... touching.', '2015-04-10 21:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340793, 1146435, 109227, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to take in here and I rather like it.  The dog along with the words "Best Friend" was the first thing I saw.  I like that the dog is standing on the try and looks like he is about to take a lick of her ear, lol.</td>', 'There is a lot to take in here and I rather like it.  The dog along with the words "Best Friend" was the first thing I saw.  I like that the dog is standing on the try and looks like he is about to take a lick of her ear, lol.', '2015-04-10 21:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
