(7340800, 1146267, 109227, '<td valign="top">I can remember as a girl doing what was called "window shopping" and this image beings those memories back.  Glamour in those days was for the wealthy and Hollywood and all I could do was dream.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'I can remember as a girl doing what was called "window shopping" and this image beings those memories back.  Glamour in those days was for the wealthy and Hollywood and all I could do was dream.  Nicely seen.', '2015-04-10 21:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340801, 1146600, 109227, '<td valign="top">A touch of whimsy among the clutter in the garage.  I have some areas like this too and can identify.  It leaves you wondering how it got there and how long has it been there.  Nicely seen and a fun image.</td>', 'A touch of whimsy among the clutter in the garage.  I have some areas like this too and can identify.  It leaves you wondering how it got there and how long has it been there.  Nicely seen and a fun image.', '2015-04-10 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
