(7340804, 1145865, 109227, '<td valign="top">Lovely, Lovely shot.  There is a human element to this dog; I have seen it in my own.  I believe it comes from a lot of love and respect.  This is a loved and respected dog keeping guard over his territory and his master.</td>', 'Lovely, Lovely shot.  There is a human element to this dog; I have seen it in my own.  I believe it comes from a lot of love and respect.  This is a loved and respected dog keeping guard over his territory and his master.', '2015-04-10 21:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
