(7340918, 1146719, 109227, '<td valign="top">Odd, in deed, but quirky and fascinating.  The cat looks like he is speaking and explaining this phenomenon and wondering why you don''t get it.  I like the painterly affect on the man''s face.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Odd, in deed, but quirky and fascinating.  The cat looks like he is speaking and explaining this phenomenon and wondering why you don''t get it.  I like the painterly affect on the man''s face.  Bumping up.', '2015-04-11 09:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
