(7340940, 1146484, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pretty is not the diminutive of beautiful.  It''s a difficult, if not actually impossible, distinction to give voice to, but here I''m trying to explain a gut reaction.  Pretty is delight, happiness and sunshine.  Beautiful is glory, impressiveness, emotional depth and, okay, delight as well.  Other stuff too.  You know it when you feel it.  This image is so uplifting.  The leaves sparkle, the background elegantly sets them off, and as the leaves approach the top they mass into abundance.  It''s a garland to spring, to joy and promise.  Very pretty.</td>', 'Pretty is not the diminutive of beautiful.  It''s a difficult, if not actually impossible, distinction to give voice to, but here I''m trying to explain a gut reaction.  Pretty is delight, happiness and sunshine.  Beautiful is glory, impressiveness, emotional depth and, okay, delight as well.  Other stuff too.  You know it when you feel it.  This image is so uplifting.  The leaves sparkle, the background elegantly sets them off, and as the leaves approach the top they mass into abundance.  It''s a garland to spring, to joy and promise.  Very pretty.', '2015-04-11 10:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340943, 1146586, 173844, '<td valign="top">Without the pink balloon this image is impressive, with its wonderfully convoluted composition and bold emphasis on the long reflection.  With it, there''s that touch of surprise and whimsy that, for me, lifts it into a less somber realm of delight.  It could be considered litter, but we can set that aside to revel in the pleasure it brings.  We can even ponder the concept of "litter".  Fine photograph.  Big smile.</td>', 'Without the pink balloon this image is impressive, with its wonderfully convoluted composition and bold emphasis on the long reflection.  With it, there''s that touch of surprise and whimsy that, for me, lifts it into a less somber realm of delight.  It could be considered litter, but we can set that aside to revel in the pleasure it brings.  We can even ponder the concept of "litter".  Fine photograph.  Big smile.', '2015-04-11 10:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
