(7340963, 1146467, 113591, '<td valign="top">They are definitely interacting with the humans, I cannot quite say that they appear grateful of the human company. So it would be the type of well-received shot, if there was a girl in a red sweater. Instead there is this group of  deer looking like they caught you cooking the church''s books.</td>', 'They are definitely interacting with the humans, I cannot quite say that they appear grateful of the human company. So it would be the type of well-received shot, if there was a girl in a red sweater. Instead there is this group of  deer looking like they caught you cooking the church''s books.', '2015-04-11 11:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7340964, 1146411, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Camouflage, alertness and staying alive is serious business, so please forgive me for indulging in the sense of sweetness I also feel.  Perhaps it''s the overall delicacy or the emotional projection of the sunlit tree trunks as guardian spirits.  The tone itself is magical.  There''s an eternal story being told here, and I thank you for sharing it.</td>', 'Lovely image.  Camouflage, alertness and staying alive is serious business, so please forgive me for indulging in the sense of sweetness I also feel.  Perhaps it''s the overall delicacy or the emotional projection of the sunlit tree trunks as guardian spirits.  The tone itself is magical.  There''s an eternal story being told here, and I thank you for sharing it.', '2015-04-11 11:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
