(7341083, 1146591, 113591, '<td valign="top">Gave me the idea of a giant on the side of a lake. Something else is more important, in spite of the giant at the edge. The expanding water ripples are much more alive and attention grabbing.</td>', 'Gave me the idea of a giant on the side of a lake. Something else is more important, in spite of the giant at the edge. The expanding water ripples are much more alive and attention grabbing.', '2015-04-11 14:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
