(7341092, 1146531, 113591, '<td valign="top">The trees and clouds do form a sort of busy background for the painted lines on the road. Those lines took my attention away from the shadows, the shadows just made them more interesting, giving them a 3-d feel.</td>', 'The trees and clouds do form a sort of busy background for the painted lines on the road. Those lines took my attention away from the shadows, the shadows just made them more interesting, giving them a 3-d feel.', '2015-04-11 14:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
