(7341113, 1146588, 113591, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it funny that we often like to be close to one another, but still apart.</td>', 'Isn''t it funny that we often like to be close to one another, but still apart.', '2015-04-11 14:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341114, 1146057, 113591, '<td valign="top">Now that it fits each of your body''s folds perfectly, and emergency money is just a deep delve away, the wife wants to throw it out.</td>', 'Now that it fits each of your body''s folds perfectly, and emergency money is just a deep delve away, the wife wants to throw it out.', '2015-04-11 14:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341116, 1146564, 113591, '<td valign="top">The contrast with a bleak background gives it a nice punch.<br/>Does lean towards being an Australian outback short story.</td>', 'The contrast with a bleak background gives it a nice punch.Does lean towards being an Australian outback short story.', '2015-04-11 14:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341118, 1145883, 113591, '<td valign="top">New is often nice, but not so much here. The buds all have their own directions and paths to follow, with a nasty curl at the top. They are also part of the dark, disorientating neighbourhood.</td>', 'New is often nice, but not so much here. The buds all have their own directions and paths to follow, with a nasty curl at the top. They are also part of the dark, disorientating neighbourhood.', '2015-04-11 14:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341119, 1146711, 113591, '<td valign="top">Normal family life. Much nicer memory than the stiff group photo next to the front door.</td>', 'Normal family life. Much nicer memory than the stiff group photo next to the front door.', '2015-04-11 14:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341122, 1146299, 113591, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit more like in riger mortis, but I''ll give you the benefit of the dead. <br/> <br/>So then, it is definitely Don Giovanni. Don''t argue. Just change your title.</td>', 'Looks a bit more like in riger mortis, but I''ll give you the benefit of the dead.  So then, it is definitely Don Giovanni. Don''t argue. Just change your title.', '2015-04-11 15:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341123, 1146054, 113411, '<td valign="top">this is brilliant and so perfect for the challenge. The wires in front of it (yikes, why so many wires?) remove it from the ''someone else''s art''<br/>problem. I wish it would make the top 3 but it is probably too clever.</td>', 'this is brilliant and so perfect for the challenge. The wires in front of it (yikes, why so many wires?) remove it from the ''someone else''s art''problem. I wish it would make the top 3 but it is probably too clever.', '2015-04-11 15:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341124, 1146364, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is too fabulous. The figure in the corner with the iPhone is just the right amount of affectation for the challenge.<br/>I am giving this an 8 and if it were in Free Study I would give it an 8, too. It''s brilliant!</td>', 'This is too fabulous. The figure in the corner with the iPhone is just the right amount of affectation for the challenge.I am giving this an 8 and if it were in Free Study I would give it an 8, too. It''s brilliant!', '2015-04-11 15:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341125, 1146534, 113411, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! As affected and edgy as it has to be. Great composition and a great tribute to ''the man''. 8 from me.</td>', 'Brilliant! As affected and edgy as it has to be. Great composition and a great tribute to ''the man''. 8 from me.', '2015-04-11 15:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341126, 1146648, 113411, '<td valign="top">just brilliant! The perfect amount of irony and edge to pay tribute to Ubique. It''s probably too subtle for a Free Study which is too bad because it is a wonderful photograph.</td>', 'just brilliant! The perfect amount of irony and edge to pay tribute to Ubique. It''s probably too subtle for a Free Study which is too bad because it is a wonderful photograph.', '2015-04-11 15:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341127, 1146717, 113411, '<td valign="top">What a perfect tribute to Ubique. You''ve captured his Gonzo irreverence and shtik wonderfully. Well done!</td>', 'What a perfect tribute to Ubique. You''ve captured his Gonzo irreverence and shtik wonderfully. Well done!', '2015-04-11 15:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341128, 1146710, 113411, '<td valign="top">Just enough edge and affectation. You really ''got to''!</td>', 'Just enough edge and affectation. You really ''got to''!', '2015-04-11 15:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341129, 1146288, 113411, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous shot and tribute to Ubique. It''s perfect!</td>', 'What a fabulous shot and tribute to Ubique. It''s perfect!', '2015-04-11 15:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341130, 1146435, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous. You''ve captured Ubique''s style to perfection..the wall art, the humor, the pov, composition  <br/>and the processing is brilliant!</td>', 'This is fabulous. You''ve captured Ubique''s style to perfection..the wall art, the humor, the pov, composition  and the processing is brilliant!', '2015-04-11 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341131, 1146634, 113411, '<td valign="top">OMG! This is fabulous. Everything about it, the soft color, the composition the ladies'' hat matches the mail box! It is<br/>brilliant and so interesting and a great tribute to Ubique.</td>', 'OMG! This is fabulous. Everything about it, the soft color, the composition the ladies'' hat matches the mail box! It isbrilliant and so interesting and a great tribute to Ubique.', '2015-04-11 15:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341132, 1146490, 113411, '<td valign="top">A perfect tribute to Ubique! It''s authentic and enigmatic and captures his point of view!</td>', 'A perfect tribute to Ubique! It''s authentic and enigmatic and captures his point of view!', '2015-04-11 15:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341133, 1146586, 113591, '<td valign="top">Sheeesh, it''s a good composition.<br/> <br/>As soon as I think I''ve seen all the scary areas, some new jawbone-part or dark mask jumps out.</td>', 'Sheeesh, it''s a good composition. As soon as I think I''ve seen all the scary areas, some new jawbone-part or dark mask jumps out.', '2015-04-11 15:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
