(7341336, 1146620, 174999, '<td valign="top">This is so one of my spark personal ribbon favorites!<br/> <br/>This really turned my head with the processing and I know Ubique loves heavy vignettes as well. so This is so his style and I am sure he will be pleased with this as much as I was when I first opened up this image,  even with the touch of blur makes it perfect. I do expect this to be a blue! I will be so disappointed if it is not.<br/>Having the subject be a pet, is one of my favorite styles, tones on this are just amazing and so well done. You should be proud of this image.<br/> <br/>Normally don''t give 10s but this one is my 10 and top fav. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1142675" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/174999/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1142675.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/174999/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1142675.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/170000-174999/174999/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1142675.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is so one of my spark personal ribbon favorites! This really turned my head with the processing and I know Ubique loves heavy vignettes as well. so This is so his style and I am sure he will be pleased with this as much as I was when I first opened up this image,  even with the touch of blur makes it perfect. I do expect this to be a blue! I will be so disappointed if it is not.Having the subject be a pet, is one of my favorite styles, tones on this are just amazing and so well done. You should be proud of this image. Normally don''t give 10s but this one is my 10 and top fav. ', '2015-04-11 21:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
