(7341442, 1146472, 137576, '<td valign="top">a 10 from me magnificent scene and beautiful tonality and contrast great composition and low angle and the people walking by are the icing on the cake, the connection of the roots of the tress and the feet of humans is nice and subtle and connects the picture together. <br/> <br/>the light on the leaf in the sweet spot of the Fibonacci spiral also an inspired touch a beacon of clarity in the dark foreboding foreground.</td>', 'a 10 from me magnificent scene and beautiful tonality and contrast great composition and low angle and the people walking by are the icing on the cake, the connection of the roots of the tress and the feet of humans is nice and subtle and connects the picture together.  the light on the leaf in the sweet spot of the Fibonacci spiral also an inspired touch a beacon of clarity in the dark foreboding foreground.', '2015-04-12 05:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
