(7341559, 1146222, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find the mechanics interesting here. There appear to be some roller bearings hanging out in midair, not doing anything. Maybe the inside races are doing the work. I am curious what this is.<br/> <br/>I expect this to do well on popular appeal, as it is visually engaging. I''m not sure that a message would be conveyed without that title to provide the connection. I''ll be curious to see how this does and the other comments it brings in.</td>', 'I find the mechanics interesting here. There appear to be some roller bearings hanging out in midair, not doing anything. Maybe the inside races are doing the work. I am curious what this is. I expect this to do well on popular appeal, as it is visually engaging. I''m not sure that a message would be conveyed without that title to provide the connection. I''ll be curious to see how this does and the other comments it brings in.', '2015-04-12 12:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
