(7341641, 1146658, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of them in this magical moment.  It''s wonderful how bright-eyed the elder gentleman is, tenderly touching life to life.  The blurred vignette is a bit strong, but certainly effective in drawing attention to the heart of the image.  Good photograph of time itself.</td>', 'Nice portrait of them in this magical moment.  It''s wonderful how bright-eyed the elder gentleman is, tenderly touching life to life.  The blurred vignette is a bit strong, but certainly effective in drawing attention to the heart of the image.  Good photograph of time itself.', '2015-04-12 17:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341646, 1146628, 173844, '<td valign="top">Eye-catching, in a good way, image of this crystal ball creating its own world and then landing on it.  I like that it''s boldly front and center, freakish and friendly.</td>', 'Eye-catching, in a good way, image of this crystal ball creating its own world and then landing on it.  I like that it''s boldly front and center, freakish and friendly.', '2015-04-12 17:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341647, 1146158, 173844, '<td valign="top">You''ve created a beautiful composition.  And a beautiful background.  Though it''s very realistic it can also absolutely work as an abstract, an artistic feat.  Great, interesting homage.</td>', 'You''ve created a beautiful composition.  And a beautiful background.  Though it''s very realistic it can also absolutely work as an abstract, an artistic feat.  Great, interesting homage.', '2015-04-12 17:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341648, 1146105, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo-journalism, full of emotion and movement. Beyond that the viewer has no idea what it''s all about, so it stands alone as emblematic of whatever drama she/he chooses.  Turmoil without context, the viewer is activated without knowing why.  Not really to the point, but I wonder if the photographer is moving forward or backpedaling.</td>', 'Terrific photo-journalism, full of emotion and movement. Beyond that the viewer has no idea what it''s all about, so it stands alone as emblematic of whatever drama she/he chooses.  Turmoil without context, the viewer is activated without knowing why.  Not really to the point, but I wonder if the photographer is moving forward or backpedaling.', '2015-04-12 17:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341649, 1146460, 173844, '<td valign="top">It''s all in his look, which is formidable, in combination with a nice composition and string contrast.  Feels like the start of a Stephen King novel.</td>', 'It''s all in his look, which is formidable, in combination with a nice composition and string contrast.  Feels like the start of a Stephen King novel.', '2015-04-12 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
