(7341679, 1146591, 137576, '<td valign="top">all great journeys start with the first step, death being the greatest, how bad is it really? walk out into the water keep going till the cold crisp water fills my lungs, wash my problems from my body leave it all behind, who cares about those who are left i only care about me and easing my own pain the cowards way out. i am the coward, or i step back i face my problems i confront my issues i fight i win i take control i conquer my demons i am true to myself its never that bad is it?</td>', 'all great journeys start with the first step, death being the greatest, how bad is it really? walk out into the water keep going till the cold crisp water fills my lungs, wash my problems from my body leave it all behind, who cares about those who are left i only care about me and easing my own pain the cowards way out. i am the coward, or i step back i face my problems i confront my issues i fight i win i take control i conquer my demons i am true to myself its never that bad is it?', '2015-04-12 18:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
