(7341722, 1146598, 40391, '<td valign="top">I do like the wet windscreen as a natural overlay. The composition and wonderful, especially with his look and the bird. The shot works well.</td>', 'I do like the wet windscreen as a natural overlay. The composition and wonderful, especially with his look and the bird. The shot works well.', '2015-04-12 20:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
