(7341724, 1146719, 19825, '<td valign="top">Juxtaposition of the absurd. Nicely done.</td>', 'Juxtaposition of the absurd. Nicely done.', '2015-04-12 20:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341725, 1145714, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image lifts the not so interesting ordinary to the very interesting ordinary.  The woman is engaged and candid, the car  has unfolded into unusually shaped and arrayed planes, the scene is modestly tilted and the sky is unsettled and grainy.  The sense of instantaneous imbalance is captivating and worth a prolonged look.  Photographer as alchemist.</td>', 'This image lifts the not so interesting ordinary to the very interesting ordinary.  The woman is engaged and candid, the car  has unfolded into unusually shaped and arrayed planes, the scene is modestly tilted and the sky is unsettled and grainy.  The sense of instantaneous imbalance is captivating and worth a prolonged look.  Photographer as alchemist.', '2015-04-12 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341726, 1146710, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lined upped beautifully.</td>', 'Lined upped beautifully.', '2015-04-12 20:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341727, 1146658, 19825, '<td valign="top">The miracle of life at both ends of the spectrum.</td>', 'The miracle of life at both ends of the spectrum.', '2015-04-12 20:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341728, 1146634, 19825, '<td valign="top">Selective color is tough to pull off. I don''t generally have the guts to even try. You have boldly done so to great effect. It helps to have such a well composted image to work with. Nicely done.</td>', 'Selective color is tough to pull off. I don''t generally have the guts to even try. You have boldly done so to great effect. It helps to have such a well composted image to work with. Nicely done.', '2015-04-12 20:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341730, 1146249, 173844, '<td valign="top">This bike rider in his/her environment is artfully blurred and I think enfolded in flare.  The suggestion is just sufficient to carry understanding, creating an intimate entente between photographer and viewer.  The title is terrific.  An accomplished statement.</td>', 'This bike rider in his/her environment is artfully blurred and I think enfolded in flare.  The suggestion is just sufficient to carry understanding, creating an intimate entente between photographer and viewer.  The title is terrific.  An accomplished statement.', '2015-04-12 20:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341731, 1146435, 138630, '<td valign="top">Fresh hotdogs!</td>', 'Fresh hotdogs!', '2015-04-12 20:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341732, 1146588, 119419, '<td valign="top">Ah the intergenerational divide, or is that a connection. A beautiful moment.</td>', 'Ah the intergenerational divide, or is that a connection. A beautiful moment.', '2015-04-12 20:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341733, 1146435, 119419, '<td valign="top">Happy and vital, just the way I like it. You have a good eye for juxtaposition.</td>', 'Happy and vital, just the way I like it. You have a good eye for juxtaposition.', '2015-04-12 20:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341734, 1145810, 119419, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the joyousness of youth, and I''m glad the pole has the right messages in the right order.</td>', 'You''ve captured the joyousness of youth, and I''m glad the pole has the right messages in the right order.', '2015-04-12 20:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341735, 1146534, 119419, '<td valign="top">Yes, a true Ubique contrast, a vibrant scene.</td>', 'Yes, a true Ubique contrast, a vibrant scene.', '2015-04-12 20:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341736, 1146712, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love walls, and these have tons of personality.  They''re very much here, but the spray-painted information makes me wonder if they''re slated for demolition.  Maybe I''d need specialized knowledge to decipher it, and so I''m already caught in uncertainty.  What are those strange openings?  Is the green algae or something?  It''s just this side of ominous, and the aforementioned uncertainty provides the energy that uplifts this image.</td>', 'I love walls, and these have tons of personality.  They''re very much here, but the spray-painted information makes me wonder if they''re slated for demolition.  Maybe I''d need specialized knowledge to decipher it, and so I''m already caught in uncertainty.  What are those strange openings?  Is the green algae or something?  It''s just this side of ominous, and the aforementioned uncertainty provides the energy that uplifts this image.', '2015-04-12 20:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341737, 1146471, 119419, '<td valign="top">Cafe Lascaux indeed, very fitting image.</td>', 'Cafe Lascaux indeed, very fitting image.', '2015-04-12 20:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341739, 1146543, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cute and classy, informal and formal, impertinent and somewhat stately.  A fun image, nicely composed, that rewards attention.</td>', 'Cute and classy, informal and formal, impertinent and somewhat stately.  A fun image, nicely composed, that rewards attention.', '2015-04-12 20:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341740, 1146436, 119419, '<td valign="top">Happiness in the French market except for the guillotined girl and the Pope behind her. A wonderful capture in all seriousness, I like the lower perspective.</td>', 'Happiness in the French market except for the guillotined girl and the Pope behind her. A wonderful capture in all seriousness, I like the lower perspective.', '2015-04-12 20:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341741, 1146598, 119419, '<td valign="top">An enjoyable play on focus and perspective, his expression is priceless.</td>', 'An enjoyable play on focus and perspective, his expression is priceless.', '2015-04-12 20:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341742, 1146715, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting and well-composed image that melts into a handsome abstract.</td>', 'Interesting and well-composed image that melts into a handsome abstract.', '2015-04-12 20:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341743, 1146587, 119419, '<td valign="top">I enjoy these combined perspectives. Always indicates a watchful demeanour and a sense of suspenseful drama.</td>', 'I enjoy these combined perspectives. Always indicates a watchful demeanour and a sense of suspenseful drama.', '2015-04-12 20:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341746, 1145714, 119419, '<td valign="top">A great piece that could launch many interpretations once you''re on board.</td>', 'A great piece that could launch many interpretations once you''re on board.', '2015-04-12 20:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341749, 1146299, 173844, '<td valign="top">I wish I could offer more than a guess as to what''s going on here.  It looks like a folded piece of cloth that somewhat suggests the head of a crow.  Maybe it serves as an inkblot that the viewer can project his/her unconscious on.</td>', 'I wish I could offer more than a guess as to what''s going on here.  It looks like a folded piece of cloth that somewhat suggests the head of a crow.  Maybe it serves as an inkblot that the viewer can project his/her unconscious on.', '2015-04-12 20:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341750, 1145715, 119419, '<td valign="top">A classic context presented well, I like the grittiness and the implied solitude of the crowd.</td>', 'A classic context presented well, I like the grittiness and the implied solitude of the crowd.', '2015-04-12 20:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341752, 1146473, 119419, '<td valign="top">The emerging elephant is magnificent, such gentleness and enormity of the scene ad the animal, you have treated this very well.</td>', 'The emerging elephant is magnificent, such gentleness and enormity of the scene ad the animal, you have treated this very well.', '2015-04-12 20:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341753, 1146543, 119419, '<td valign="top">So gaudily iconic that it is brilliant, thank you.</td>', 'So gaudily iconic that it is brilliant, thank you.', '2015-04-12 20:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341754, 1146715, 119419, '<td valign="top">Very gentle and soothing</td>', 'Very gentle and soothing', '2015-04-12 20:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341755, 1146490, 119419, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the scenes within scenes. It makes me want to explore so much more.</td>', 'I enjoy the scenes within scenes. It makes me want to explore so much more.', '2015-04-12 20:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341756, 1145715, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pulling away in distance tends to deindividualize, if not dehumanize, people.  Here the distance is not so far as to accomplish that, but far enough to allow a bit of abstraction.  The white lines are so strong that I''m seeing the people becoming like vagrant notes on a continuous staff.  And a nice little symphony it is.</td>', 'Pulling away in distance tends to deindividualize, if not dehumanize, people.  Here the distance is not so far as to accomplish that, but far enough to allow a bit of abstraction.  The white lines are so strong that I''m seeing the people becoming like vagrant notes on a continuous staff.  And a nice little symphony it is.', '2015-04-12 20:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341757, 1146710, 173844, '<td valign="top">A cinematic moment of suspense and mystery.  There''s an interesting progression from mannequin to smoker to back-turned man.  The thrown shadows are also interesting.  A handsome and nicely handled tableau.</td>', 'A cinematic moment of suspense and mystery.  There''s an interesting progression from mannequin to smoker to back-turned man.  The thrown shadows are also interesting.  A handsome and nicely handled tableau.', '2015-04-12 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
