(7341777, 1146354, 103142, '<td valign="top">I do like it, but it''s so dark. At first I thought the dark was intriguing, but then I just found it a bit irritating because it gets in the way of really enjoying it. sorry...</td>', 'I do like it, but it''s so dark. At first I thought the dark was intriguing, but then I just found it a bit irritating because it gets in the way of really enjoying it. sorry...', '2015-04-12 22:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
