(7341779, 1145853, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that seems too dark. But for this one, it''s working a lot better than the other ones. Intriguing, but I''m not sure the interest would last.</td>', 'Another one that seems too dark. But for this one, it''s working a lot better than the other ones. Intriguing, but I''m not sure the interest would last.', '2015-04-12 22:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341780, 1146168, 103142, '<td valign="top">I want to like this one, but it''s not doing much for me. I''m wondering if it would have been more interesting in b&amp;w. It seems like it doesn''t go anywhere.</td>', 'I want to like this one, but it''s not doing much for me. I''m wondering if it would have been more interesting in b&w. It seems like it doesn''t go anywhere.', '2015-04-12 22:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341781, 1146288, 103142, '<td valign="top">This one definitely works for me. A Riot of Lines is what I immediately thought. You can just keep following them around the photo and it''s fun to explore.</td>', 'This one definitely works for me. A Riot of Lines is what I immediately thought. You can just keep following them around the photo and it''s fun to explore.', '2015-04-12 22:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341782, 1146711, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is the type of photo that I find interesting. I like that there''s a story here, and you''re just not sure what the story is. Her reaction intrigues and has you guessing.</td>', 'This is the type of photo that I find interesting. I like that there''s a story here, and you''re just not sure what the story is. Her reaction intrigues and has you guessing.', '2015-04-12 22:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341783, 1146267, 103142, '<td valign="top">Again -- another one with a story. Stories are important in a good photograph, imo. Perhaps this one hits me on a female level. It really draws me in. But then again, I do like dress up. :)</td>', 'Again -- another one with a story. Stories are important in a good photograph, imo. Perhaps this one hits me on a female level. It really draws me in. But then again, I do like dress up. :)', '2015-04-12 22:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341784, 1146461, 103142, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the title. But the picture interests me. Which surprises me. I do like bench shots. But this one goes beyond. Probably because it the receptacle looks so much like a urn they have for flowers next to graves in cemeteries. This, with the emptiness of the shot, makes it feel kind of lonely.</td>', 'Not sure of the title. But the picture interests me. Which surprises me. I do like bench shots. But this one goes beyond. Probably because it the receptacle looks so much like a urn they have for flowers next to graves in cemeteries. This, with the emptiness of the shot, makes it feel kind of lonely.', '2015-04-12 22:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341785, 1146634, 103142, '<td valign="top">Love this. 9 and a fav. The shadows have almost nothing to do with the photo, they''re surreal and other worldly. Makes me feel like aliens are invading. And the person is so interesting to begin with. The wall is perfect. Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Love this. 9 and a fav. The shadows have almost nothing to do with the photo, they''re surreal and other worldly. Makes me feel like aliens are invading. And the person is so interesting to begin with. The wall is perfect. Wonderful shot!', '2015-04-12 22:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341786, 1146435, 103142, '<td valign="top">Hehe -- love the title. Like the dog. Like the fact that she''s starting to go out of the frame. I think that makes the shot, actually. I''m not exactly sure why. It leaves the story open and unfinished -- which works.</td>', 'Hehe -- love the title. Like the dog. Like the fact that she''s starting to go out of the frame. I think that makes the shot, actually. I''m not exactly sure why. It leaves the story open and unfinished -- which works.', '2015-04-12 22:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341787, 1146598, 103142, '<td valign="top">Didn''t think much of this on first glance. But it grew on me. I''ve been liking the cutoff portions on other photos. For some reason, I wish his feet weren''t cut off on this one. It may be a sense of balance that I feel I''m missing. Unbalanced photos are quite nice, but this one seems to need it. That being said, it did grow on me quite a bit, and I like your title.</td>', 'Didn''t think much of this on first glance. But it grew on me. I''ve been liking the cutoff portions on other photos. For some reason, I wish his feet weren''t cut off on this one. It may be a sense of balance that I feel I''m missing. Unbalanced photos are quite nice, but this one seems to need it. That being said, it did grow on me quite a bit, and I like your title.', '2015-04-12 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341788, 1146580, 103142, '<td valign="top">Seems like the story is a little too complete on this one. The shadow is wonderful, but it doesn''t leave me wondering. It seems like I already know it all.</td>', 'Seems like the story is a little too complete on this one. The shadow is wonderful, but it doesn''t leave me wondering. It seems like I already know it all.', '2015-04-12 22:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341790, 1146158, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok. I keep thinking this one is going to be boring. But it''s fun to follow the lines and curves, and it does make me curious. It intrigues me more than I wanted it to. :)</td>', 'Ok. I keep thinking this one is going to be boring. But it''s fun to follow the lines and curves, and it does make me curious. It intrigues me more than I wanted it to. :)', '2015-04-12 22:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341791, 1146586, 103142, '<td valign="top">The balloon almost detracts in this one. Usually I love abandoned balloons, but the rest is very interesting with nice lines. I''m almost a tad irritated that the balloon is breaking my site line.</td>', 'The balloon almost detracts in this one. Usually I love abandoned balloons, but the rest is very interesting with nice lines. I''m almost a tad irritated that the balloon is breaking my site line.', '2015-04-12 22:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341792, 1146714, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- the officer cuffing has really creep eyes! Man, look at that guys arm! Two guns down? The dirt on the door. I want to know the story behind this one. Seems like a lot to stage, but having the gun so near the guy''s hand seems bizarre. A lot to discover here.</td>', 'Ok -- the officer cuffing has really creep eyes! Man, look at that guys arm! Two guns down? The dirt on the door. I want to know the story behind this one. Seems like a lot to stage, but having the gun so near the guy''s hand seems bizarre. A lot to discover here.', '2015-04-12 22:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7341793, 1146719, 103142, '<td valign="top">Absolutely, incredibly fantastic. Stopped me in my tracks the first time through. Same the second. Should be hanging on my wall. I''m not sure I''d ever get tired of it.</td>', 'Absolutely, incredibly fantastic. Stopped me in my tracks the first time through. Same the second. Should be hanging on my wall. I''m not sure I''d ever get tired of it.', '2015-04-12 22:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
