(7342469, 1146634, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> A blue ribbon in a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a> challenge with a color photo. Add this to your long list of achievements. Congratulations! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s funny because I was thinking the same thing!</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: A blue ribbon in a  ubique challenge with a color photo. Add this to your long list of achievements. Congratulations!   That''s funny because I was thinking the same thing!', '2015-04-14 22:43:56.000000', NULL, 0),
