(7342653, 1146634, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> A blue ribbon in a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a> challenge with a color photo. Add this to your long list of achievements. Congratulations! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks! Yeah, I was contemplating entering something monochromatic and blurry but then thought, what the heck, the goal is not to imitate ubique''s own photography or even taste, but make an interesting photo worthy of his comment</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: A blue ribbon in a  ubique challenge with a color photo. Add this to your long list of achievements. Congratulations!  Thanks! Yeah, I was contemplating entering something monochromatic and blurry but then thought, what the heck, the goal is not to imitate ubique''s own photography or even taste, but make an interesting photo worthy of his comment', '2015-04-15 13:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
